<header><p class="enc-kicker">Person</p><h1 class="enc-title">Micanopy</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">c. 1780–<a href="/years/1849">1849</a></span> · <a href="/centuries/19th-century">19th century</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Micanopy was a principal chief of the Seminole in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/florida">Florida</a>. He was among the leaders of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/second-seminole-war">Second Seminole War</a>, taking part in the attack on Major Dade's column in December 1835. Captured in 1837, he was removed to <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/indian-territory">Indian Territory</a>, where he remained a leading chief until his death.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/micanopy.jpg" alt="Micanopy" width="256" height="333" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: Public domain · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Micancopy.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
